***** (AS PREVIOUSLY APPROVED UNDER COM2011-05425). This project is limited to the reinstallation of the existing rooftop photovoltaic (PV) solar system that was previously removed to facilitate the completed reroofing work. The reinstallation consists solely of returning the existing PV equipment to the rooftop and restoring the existing rooftop array using the same equipment and substantially the same configuration in which it was previously installed. The existing PV modules, ballast, racking, and associated DC-side components are being reinstalled as existing equipment. No new photovoltaic modules, additional generating capacity, new array sections, or expansion of the existing PV system are proposed under this permit. The reinstallation is intended to restore the previously existing rooftop PV system following its temporary removal for the completed reroofing work. Scope of this permit is limited to the existing rooftop PV array and associated mechanical and DC-side components, including: ***** 

   SCOPE OF WORK:
 ----- EXTERIOR ALTERATIONS ------
 - Existing photovoltaic modules/panels;
 - Existing ballast and ballast blocks;
 - Existing racking and mounting assemblies;
 - Existing module mounting and attachment hardware;
 - Existing rooftop DC conductors associated with the PV array;
 - Existing DC conduit, fittings, supports, and associated DC-side raceway components; and
 - Associated hardware necessary to secure and reconnect these existing rooftop/DC-side components.
    AS PER PLANS AND AS PER CODE.

